  "steps": [
    "Place the ricotta, yoghurt, cream cheese, Baileys, sweetener and vanilla extract in a mixing bowl and mix until smooth. Make up gelatine with 4 tbsp of cold water and whisk into the cheesecake mix until fully incorporated.",
    "Pour the mix equally into ten 100ml ramekin dishes and refrigerate for at least 2 hours.",
    "When set, top with crushed cookies and serve."
